.TH FL-WEB 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-web \- web browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-web\fR [\fB\-\-private\fR] [\fB\-\-new\-window\fR] [\fIURL\fR|\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A web browser built with FLTK and \fBWPE WebKit\fR. Each URL or file given opens in a tab; text
that is not an address is searched for.
.PP
The address bar takes addresses, file paths and searches, and completes what you type from
your bookmarks and history. Pages opened by a page (and links clicked with the middle button
or Ctrl) open in new tabs. Downloads go to the Downloads folder; a notification says when one
has finished. Pages that ask for a password, a file, your location or to show notifications ask
you first.
.PP
Tabs can be dragged to a new place, or out of the tab strip into a window of their own; a
right click on a tab has New Tab, Reload, Duplicate, Bookmark, Copy Address, Move to New
Window, Close, Close Other Tabs, Close Tabs to the Right and Reopen Closed Tab. A right click
in the page has the link, image, editing and page commands (Save Page As, View Page Source,
Full Screen, Inspect).
.PP
A private window (\fB\-\-private\fR, Ctrl+Shift+N) keeps its cookies and site data in memory
only, and records no history and no session. Its tab strip is purple.
.PP
The developer tools (F12) are WebKit's Web Inspector: fl-web serves it on a loopback port
chosen at start, and F12 opens it in a window that lists the pages to inspect. They can be
turned off in Settings.
.PP
fl-web draws pages with the CPU: WebKit renders into shared memory and fl-web copies the
picture into its window.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\fBCtrl+L\fR, \fBF6\fR, \fBAlt+D\fR
Edit the address.
.TP
\fBCtrl+T\fR, \fBCtrl+W\fR, \fBCtrl+N\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+N\fR
New tab, close the tab, new window, new private window.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+T\fR
Reopen the last closed tab.
.TP
\fBCtrl+Tab\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+Tab\fR, \fBCtrl+1\fR..\fBCtrl+9\fR
Next, previous, n-th tab (9: the last one).
.TP
\fBAlt+Left\fR, \fBAlt+Right\fR, \fBAlt+Home\fR
Back, forward, home page.
.TP
\fBF5\fR, \fBCtrl+R\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+R\fR, \fBEsc\fR
Reload, reload without the cache, stop.
.TP
\fBCtrl+F\fR, \fBF3\fR, \fBShift+F3\fR
Find in the page, next and previous match.
.TP
\fBCtrl++\fR, \fBCtrl+\-\fR, \fBCtrl+0\fR
Zoom in, out, actual size.
.TP
\fBCtrl+D\fR, \fBCtrl+Shift+O\fR, \fBCtrl+H\fR, \fBCtrl+J\fR
Bookmark the page, bookmarks, history, downloads.
.TP
\fBF11\fR
Full screen.
.TP
\fBF12\fR, \fBCtrl+U\fR, \fBCtrl+S\fR
Developer tools, view the page source (in the text editor), save the page (MHTML).
.TP
\fBCtrl+Shift+M\fR
Show or hide the menu bar.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.config/fldesktop/web.ini\fR
Settings: home page, search engine, JavaScript, reopening the last session's tabs, natural
scrolling (\fBNaturalScrolling\fR), the menu bar (\fBShowMenuBar\fR, off by default) and the
developer tools (\fBDeveloperTools\fR).
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/fl-web/\fR
Bookmarks (\fIbookmarks.tsv\fR), history (\fIhistory.tsv\fR), cookies and site data.
.TP
\fI~/.cache/fl-web/\fR
The web cache.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-files\fR(1)
